WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.608
Unit five. Understanding Feelings!

2
00:00:04.572 --> 00:00:08.390
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.798
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.848 --> 00:00:16.031
Today we learn about Understanding Feelings. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.991 --> 00:00:20.891
Emotion. Say it with me. Emotion!

6
00:00:24.393 --> 00:00:28.093
Empathy. Say it with me. Empathy!

7
00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:35.131
Kindness. Say it with me. Kindness!

8
00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:42.108
Comfort. Say it with me. Comfort!

9
00:00:45.619 --> 00:00:49.169
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

10
00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:56.337
Support. Say it with me. Support!

11
00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:03.527
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

12
00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:10.510
Patience. Say it with me. Patience!

13
00:01:14.011 --> 00:01:24.185
Understanding my own emotion helps me show empathy to others. A little kindness and comfort can support a friend who is sad. I try to listen with respect and patience.

14
00:01:24.235 --> 00:01:25.489
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.866 --> 00:01:32.016
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.066 --> 00:01:33.216
Kindness!

17
00:01:34.044 --> 00:01:39.370
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.570
Respect!

19
00:01:41.444 --> 00:01:45.975
Did you know? Being kind to others can actually make you feel happier too!

20
00:01:46.025 --> 00:01:48.020
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.404 --> 00:01:57.761
Think and answer. How can you support a friend who is feeling sad?

22
00:01:57.811 --> 00:01:58.961
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:05.093
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.143 --> 00:02:07.754
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

